 "notes": "Table XV(i) Language, rows = State totals (including/excluding Civil and Military Station, Bangalore), 11 districts/cities, and C&M Station Bangalore; columns = languages x Persons/Males/Females. Table spans printed pp. 204-213 (leaves 212-221); only this leaf transcribed here. Nil cells ('...') omitted; blank cells also omitted. Checks passed: P=M+F for every record; State incl. = State excl. + C&M Station; State excl. = sum of the 11 districts/cities, for every column. Throughout this scan the digit 4 in light-face figures often prints as a thin vertical stroke that resembles 1; each such digit was resolved under magnification and confirmed by the P=M+F and district-sum checks. Bangalore City Total (col 4) read 171,469 (the 4 is weak). Whole-table check: for every row and sex, Population (cols 1-3) = A Total (col 4-6) + B Total (col 121-123, leaf 219) + C Total (col 145-147, leaf 220), and A Total = sum of all 35 A-language columns across leaves 212-219; all reconcile exactly."
